      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im writing a briefing for a policy group about the energy transition. can u give me a rundown on whether it's better for govts to push for an immediate phase-out of fossil fuels to hit climate goals, or if they should take a slower approach to protect the economy and keep energy prices low? basically what's the most effective way to handle the transition?",
